<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      background: #f4f6fa;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 16px;
      color: #1e293b;
    }
    
    .phone-frame {
      max-width: 390px;
      width: 100%;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 36px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      padding: 20px 20px 24px;
    }
    
    .app-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    
    .app-header h1 {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b3b5c, #1a6b8a);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    
    .badge-domain {
      background: #eef2f6;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #1e4a6b;
    }
    
    .subhead {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #4b5b6e;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e9edf2;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    
    .subhead span:last-child {
      background: #d0dfeb;
      padding: 2px 12px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1a4d6e;
    }
    
    .content-card {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 18px 16px 16px;
      margin: 12px 0 16px;
      border: 1px solid #e4ebf3;
    }
    
    .content-title {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      color: #103a52;
    }
    
    .content-desc {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #2a4d69;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    
    .part-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 6px 0 4px;
    }
    
    .part-list li {
      padding: 12px 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e9f0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
    }
    
    .part-list li:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    
    .part-list li strong {
      color: #0f3b54;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    
    .part-list li span {
      color: #1f405a;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    
    .action-bar {
      margin-top: 16px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    
    .back-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #2a6b8f;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      background: #e9f0f7;
      padding: 8px 18px;
      border-radius: 40px;
      transition: 0.15s;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
    }
    
    .back-link:hover {
      background: #d6e4f0;
      border-color: #b6cee2;
    }
    
    .year {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #7b94ab;
    }
    
    .footer {
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #788fa3;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e9f0;
      padding-top: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    
    .footer .tag {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #3b617c;
    }
    
    @media (max-width: 420px) {
      .phone-frame { padding: 16px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="phone-frame">
    <%- include('../partials/header', { domain: domain }) %>
    
    <div class="content-card">
      <h2 class="content-title">⚙️ Sparepart Sepeda</h2>
      <p class="content-desc">Berikut bagian-bagian penting yang membentuk sepeda secara utuh:</p>
      
      <ul class="part-list">
        <li>
          <strong>Rangka</strong>
          <span>Kerangka utama yang menopang seluruh beban dan komponen lain.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Sistem Penggerak</strong>
          <span>Terdiri dari pedal, engkol, rantai, gir depan dan gir belakang.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Sistem Pengereman</strong>
          <span>Tuas rem, kabel rem, kampas rem, dan cakram piringan.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Bagian Roda</strong>
          <span>Velg, jari-jari, ban dalam serta ban luar.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Bagian Lainnya</strong>
          <span>Sadel, stang, pegangan, spakbor, dan standar.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      
      <div class="action-bar">
        <a href="/" class="back-link">← Kembali</a>
        <span class="year">2026 · Sepeda untuk Semua ❤️</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
  </div>
</body>
</html>